WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.637
I have a Clicky that keeps my job search moving.

00:03.637 --> 00:05.899
One short update, every morning.

00:06.299 --> 00:09.737
Then my friend got HeyClicky, and asked the obvious question.

00:09.837 --> 00:14.868
Today, a new Clicky starts from a few questions. Not from one a friend already runs.

00:15.768 --> 00:17.682
So I built Share-a-Clicky.

00:17.682 --> 00:22.150
Each shared Clicky shows what it does, how often it runs, and the apps it needs.

00:22.200 --> 00:24.854
Copy the setup. Paste it into New Clicky.

00:24.854 --> 00:27.276
About twenty seconds later, it's ready.

00:27.476 --> 00:29.468
Your invite link comes along.

00:29.468 --> 00:33.314
And if a daily routine needs Pro, it says so before you install.

00:34.064 --> 00:39.764
It works inside HeyClicky too. Add one connector, and any Clicky can hand you a shared setup.

00:40.514 --> 00:42.630
Building it, I found two gaps.

00:42.630 --> 00:45.782
Connectors on your Mac stop after the first message.

00:45.882 --> 00:50.688
And a Clicky can't create a Clicky yet. So install is one paste, not one click.

00:51.488 --> 00:54.459
Share-a-Clicky. Start with a Clicky that already works.
